IptablesWeb is a free software (under GPL licence): it allow to inspect 
iptables logs , to receive email and alert using a web browser.

It's a plugin-based multilanguage and multiuser software written in PHP.

The features:
* Core based (IptablesWeb core)
* Plugin based thank to increase software potentiality
* Multilanguage
* Multiuser; guest, user and admin account
* Each account joins in a group
* Each plugin can be duplicated in 'n' blocks. Every block have 
characteristic independent
* Secure; IptablesWeb is protect by htaccess and regular expression
* Portable; the system can be used with any database
* Fully object oriented
* CSS & XHTML1.1 standard
* Refresh settings: the update time can be setted on each block to reduce 
the cpu load
* Drag & drop fetures: each user can define blocks to display and block 
order

Further information http://iptablesweb.sourceforge.net/

